tic was calculated to test for statistically significant differences between the 2010 and 2016 measures\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"each using a random draw of the HIV incidence rate from a normal distribution\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The PAP disparity measure was calculated as the number of excess incident infections among black females divided by the total\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"To increase precision in the analyses because incident infection counts in the surveillance report were rounded to the nearest hundred\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}